  "description": "Standalone expression-driven control nodes for FluxFlow: flow.filter passes matching messages and drops the rest, flow.when routes each message to its WhenTrue/WhenFalse ports. Each node takes an IFlowExpressionEngine directly and depends only on FluxFlow.Nodes and FluxFlow.Mapping. No engine required.",
